# A returned Aura asks for its host partway through the resolution that made its exiler leave (CR 610.3, 303.4f). Bot2's
# Temporary Lockdown has exiled Bot2's Sazh's Chocobo, the Rancor enchanting it and a Mox Emerald (mana value 2 or less);
# Bot1's Hired Blade and Elvish Spirit Guide (3 each) stayed. Bot1's Assassin's Trophy destroys the Lockdown: the three
# return at once, under Bot2's control (CR 610.3c, 610.3d), and Bot2 chooses what the Rancor enchants as it enters - of
# Bot1's two creatures, the Elvish Spirit Guide (the Chocobo entering with it is not there to be chosen) - all before the
# Trophy's next instruction. Only then does Bot2 search for a basic land and put it onto the battlefield, which the
# returned Chocobo sees enter (its landfall counter). The question is asked of the position just after the Lockdown
# left, with no Forest searched for yet, and the resolution goes on with the answer.

